From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 17:26:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(widget): welcome card (theme.welcomeCard)

A card on the empty first screen, set by the host in theme.welcomeCard:
{ title, body?, steps?, icon?, dismissable?, dismissLabel?, id? }. Shown
until the user sends a message, in the floating, side-panel, mobile and
full-page layouts. Fixed by default; a dismissable one remembers it was
dismissed per agent in this browser (same store as the feedback/consent
flags). Lazy-loaded to stay inside the entry bundle budget.

